{"id":"n89036-1-8","stage":3,"title":"환불 · 退款","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89036-1-8-1","ko":"학원 수강료를 돌려주시면 안 되나요?","zh":"能不能把补习班的学费退给我呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학원","meaning":"补习班，培训班","explanation":"학원：补习班，培训班","readings":[{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72425","senseId":"2","lemma":"학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수강료를","meaning":"听课费，学费","explanation":"수강료：听课费，学费；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"수강료","audio":"/audio/f490f6b954da382af90d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64034","senseId":"1","lemma":"수강료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌려주시면","meaning":"还给，归还，退还","explanation":"돌려주다：还给，归还，退还；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌려주다","audio":"/audio/b3f7b95886de6d800379.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66267","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌려주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a34f3f1b2a44f15f","term":"학원","zh":"补习班，培训班","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3","entryId":"72425","definition":"招收学生并教授其知识、技术及艺术体育等的私立教育机关。","pronunciation":["하권"]},{"id":"f490f6b954da382a","term":"수강료","zh":"听课费，学费","audio":"/audio/f490f6b954da382af90d.mp3","entryId":"64034","definition":"为了听讲课或受培训而缴纳的钱。","pronunciation":["수강뇨"]},{"id":"b3f7b95886de6d80","term":"돌려주다","zh":"还给，归还，退还","audio":"/audio/b3f7b95886de6d800379.mp3","entryId":"66267","definition":"把借、抢或收到的财物还给原主。","pronunciation":